#. copy/governanceLead
#: src/js/live-campus.js:13
msgctxt "tree:copy#/governanceLead"
msgid ""
"Baseline votes come from schools, facilities, clubs, and airborne "
"stakeholders. Cast or change one on this device; the count does not pretend "
"the campus suddenly agrees."
msgstr "底票は学部、施設、団体、飛行する利害関係者から構成。この端末で一票を投じ、変更できます。票数は全学合意を装いません。"

